# Borrowed reference art for the public pages — NOT OURS, and deliberately not
# in git history. These are HHPoker's banners, install screenshots and welcome
# videos, on loan so the layout can be judged at real proportions (~32 MB).
#
# They are stand-ins. Committing them would put a competitor's produced
# marketing material permanently in our history, where removing it later means
# rewriting history. The READMEs that say what belongs in each slot ARE tracked,
# so the shape of what Olivia owes us survives without the borrowed files.
